{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56098","headline":"真人赞六首 三 · 杜光庭","name":"真人赞六首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄者七宝林，十华幷弥罗。\n紫烟冠灵晖，云京秀玉阿。\n上有福德堂，宫室互参差。\n皆是清信士，真仙飞天家。\n三界通玄路，五道清不邪。\n善缘应根生，累功享福多。\n牵对相寻续，大法谅不虚。\n无有万年人，皆与劫同徂。\n依依欢乐世，发言成咏歌。\n此世欢无极，常奈来运何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}